{
    "title": "Invitation card Maker, Design",
    "description": "Create a personalized invitation card design for birthday party, engagement, wedding, anniversary, baby shower events and party. Invitation maker  helps you design the invitation and greeting card to wish your loved ones.\r\n\r\nDigital Invitation maker is customized from splendid graphic designer software so you can design anything with this app. You can create personalized invitation design using photo and text. We have given all important stickers, icons and images to add in your design to make a beautiful invitation.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat you have in Invitation maker 2023 app :\r\n1. 200+ Ready-made invitation templates to create your own invitation, RSVP and greeting card in 2 minutes.\r\n2. Invitation background images, gradient colors, photo frames and unlimited stickers for all events or upload your own image.\r\n3. Edit or Replace the text, name, event location, timing in the invitation. You can add your own text or quote with various font style. You can upload your own font or download the font for your language, decoration. Use stylish font to match your theme.\r\n4. Replace the image in one tap without changing the design.\r\n5. Beautiful photo filters and effects for advanced editing including Brightness, contrast, overlay image, crop by shape.\r\n6. Resize the invitation card in various size.\r\n7. Share the digital invitation ecard in social network like Facebook, Instagram, Snapchat, whatsapp, twitter etc.\r\n8. Save the invitation for editing in future. \r\n9. Download the digital card or print it.\r\n\r\nBirthday invitation card maker 2023:\r\nCreate birthday invitation cards with photo and text using various birthday themes. We have b'day invitation templates for themes such as animation movie cartoon characters, first birthday for boy little, man prince and girl princess theme.\r\nMake your kid's first birthday very special with theme based cake cutting event. For that you need to match the invite card for the event. We have given blue and pink unicorn, flamingo, jungle theme and many more to match with your birthday party.\r\n\r\nWedding invitation card maker:\r\nMarriage is a important event for you and your family.\r\nTo invite your friends and relative you expect a very unique wedding invitation design with save the date card format.\r\nMarriage tradition varies with culture and religion so Choose from Classic, modern, stylish, Indian wedding invitation designs. You just need to replace bride and groom photo, name, marriage location and timing.\r\n\r\n\r\nEngagement invitation card maker:\r\nFor Engagement party or ring ceremony and Bridal shower invitation design, you have various card templates here.\r\n\r\nBaby shower:\r\nYou can create the invitation for baby shower with due date, boy or girl gender reveal in various themes and also we have designs for Baby naming ceremony.\r\n\r\nVirtual Greeting card maker: Wish your dear ones with digital greeting card to wish for festivals, events, marriage and birthday wishes with quotes. You can also make status for whatsapp, facebook and instagram.\r\n\r\nwe are trying to give best invitation editor for all your needs, try it now. If any doubt email us.",
